Third-party data

The MIT License above covers the code and documentation written for this
project. It does not cover data from other sources, which remains under its
owners' terms:

- Industry and country data from Prof. Aswath Damodaran, NYU Stern
  (valuation_engine/reference_data.json, source_data/damodaran/), published
  free of charge at https://pages.stern.nyu.edu/~adamodar/
- Round valuation figures from PitchBook (Q2 2026 European VC Valuations
  Report) and Scorecard benchmarks from Equidam, cited with their sources in
  valuation_engine/reference_data.json
- Round size and dilution benchmarks from Dealroom, Carta and the KfW VC
  Dashboard, cited in the same file
